segler (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First packaged build. A window whose main pane is the document rendered
    from the tree and edited in place, with the element tree on the left, the
    element's properties on the right, and an archive's page images as an
    optional side panel. Validation against the DocLang schema and rules, with
    each finding a click from its element. The segler command-line tool over
    the same library: inspect, validate, page, render, table, edit and corpus.

 -- David M. Anderson <david.anderson@excelano.com>  Sun, 06 Sep 2026 14:40:19 -0500
